    "On-demand rates: official USD list (KR_WEST), excluding VAT (verified 2026-09-28). Public/general offering; the Enterprise/Finance offerings are separate and not modelled.",
    "Savings require specific type, quantity, term; headline up to 55% is not an unconditional discount.",
    "Unknowns remain null, not free. Commitment regimes (Cost Savings / Planned Compute) flagged sales+commit; their rates are not encoded.",
