    "VAT basis: portal says \"All prices exclude VAT.\"",
    "Residency: Region/enterprise/finance offerings selected in calculator; exact locations and residency commitment unresolved.",
    "Billing granularity/minimum not published (card treats as per-second; could under-count short sessions). Disk (Block Storage), IPv4 and egress not encoded."
